        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ansel Elgort, Edgar Wright\n- Works: Carrie, The Divergent Series, The Fault in Our Stars, Baby Driver\n- Characters: Tommy Ross, Caleb Prior, Augustus Waters, Baby\n- Topics: Film roles, Plot\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Ansel Elgort played Tommy Ross in the horror film \"Carrie.\"\n- Ansel Elgort played Caleb Prior in The Divergent Series franchise.\n- In 2014, Ansel Elgort played Augustus Waters in the romantic teen drama \"The Fault in Our Stars.\"\n- In 2017, Ansel Elgort played the title character in Edgar Wright's action thriller \"Baby Driver.\"\n- In \"Baby Driver,\" Baby is a young getaway driver and music lover who must work for a kingpin.",
